@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080

### 1. Register a new user (expect 201 Created)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Arjun Mehta",
  "email": "Arjun@Example.com",
  "password": "password123"
}

### 2. Same email again, different capitals (expect 409 Conflict)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Arjun Again",
  "email": "arjun@example.com",
  "password": "password123"
}

### 3. Bad input (expect 400 with a list of errors)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "",
  "email": "not-an-email",
  "password": "short"
}

### 4. Broken JSON (expect 400)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Arjun"